# Sayu Nahida Furina Bennett. ~20s Rot. Sayu Burgeon in 2 Target. Sayu does full duration Windwheels. Sayu's almost always absorbs Pyro with Bennett's Q. Bennett fills time if Sayu is on CD. Furina provides Hydro app without NAs while vaping off Burning aura. 

# Team
sayu char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
sayu add weapon="favgs" refine=3 lvl=90/90;
sayu add set="vv" count=4;
sayu add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 em=187 em=187;
